ent-ActionReplicatorConvert = Convert
    .desc = Nanites take over the wall or the floor you point at. Walls cost a pinch of replisteel, floors are free.
ent-ActionReplicatorBuildWall = Build wall
    .desc = Raise a replicator wall on a free tile. Costs half a sheet of replisteel.
ent-ActionReplicatorBuildFabricator = Build fabricator
    .desc = Build a fabricator that assembles new replicator shells. Costs four sheets of replisteel.
ent-ActionReplicatorHolowall = Project holowall
    .desc = Weave a holowall that keeps the air in but lets everyone through. It fades after three minutes. Costs a pinch of replisteel.
